---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

const pageTitle = "amaan khan | about";
---
<BaseLayout pageTitle={pageTitle}>
	<p>
		i am currently a master's student studying computer engineering at washu (in st. louis). i also completed my undergrad
		at washu, where i majored in computer science. broadly, my research interests lie in creating safe and robust cyber-physical 
		autonomous systems. i've had the privilege of exploring these interests deeply through my involvement in 
		<a href="https://engineering.washu.edu/faculty/Hussein-Sibai.html">prof. hussein sibai's</a> research group, where i have primarily 
		focused on developing novel conformal perception contracts for occupancy-based safe planning in autonomous driving settings.
	</p>
	<p>
		<i>
			this website was written in <a href="https://astro.build/">astro</a> and deployed on github pages with a custom domain. here's the 
			<a href="https://github.com/amaan-19/website">source code</a> if you're interested.
		</i>
	</p>
</BaseLayout>